
# 2025-11-20 14:29:47.896583
+Code the following app
+```
+Create a fully functional Notes Taker App with a clean, minimal interface.
+
+Core Requirements:
+
+Users can create, edit, and delete notes.
+
+Support for plain text and rich text formatting (bold, italic, underline, bullets).
+
+Notes should be autosaved in real time.
+
+Add a search bar to instantly find notes by title or content.
+
+Ability to pin notes to keep them at the top.
+
+Option to categorize notes with tags or folders.
+
+Include a light/dark theme toggle.
+
+Extra Features:
+
+Add a quick “Add Note” button floating on the screen.
+
+Allow users to archive notes instead of deleting permanently.
+
+Provide an optional password/lock for specific notes.
+
+Make the layout responsive for mobile and desktop.
+
+UI Requirements:
+
+Clean, modern layout similar to Google Keep or iOS Notes.
+
+List view with titles, timestamps, and preview text.
+
+Simple editor screen with a distraction-free writing space.
+
+Technical Requirements:
+
+Use any stack supported by the AI (React preferred).
+
+Store notes locally (localStorage or built-in DB).
+
+Smooth transitions between note list & editing view.
+
+Goal: Build a fast, intuitive, user-friendly notes app that makes writing and organizing thoughts effortless.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

